    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Superb two-bedroom ground floor apartment in a secure gated development. \r\nNewcombe Estates are delighted to present No.23 The Mills, a bright and spacious two-bedroom ground floor apartment ideally located on the sought-after Old Navan Road in Castleknock. \r\nThe well-presented residence offers generously proportioned accommodation throughout, featuring two double bedrooms, a spacious living area, and direct access to a private patio overlooking the beautifully maintained communal gardens.  The property enjoys a peaceful setting within a secure gated development with electric gates, while benefitting from excellent transport links and local amenities. \r\nThe Mill is ideally situated on the Old Navan Road, within easy reach of Castleknock Village, Blanchardstown Town Centre, and a host of local amenities including shops, restaurants, schools, sporting facilities, and parks. The property is within walking distance of Castleknock Railway Station and benefits from excellent access to the N3, M50, and Dublin City Centre, making it an ideal choice for commuters. \r\nThis attractive apartment offers a wonderful opportunity for first time buyers, downsizers, and investors seeking a quality home in one of Dublin 15’s most convenient and established residential locations."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall: with ceramic tiled floor \r\n\r\nLounge/Dining Room: open plan living space, feature marble fireplace with wood surround, laminate wood floor and double doors to garden area\t    \t\tc.6.9x3.1m\r\n\r\nKitchen:   with white modern floor and wall mounted fitted kitchen, tiled behind work-top, tiled floor, plumbed for washing machine and dishwasher, oven and hob\t\t\r\nc.2.5x1.9m\t\t\r\n\r\nBedroom 1: with built in wardrobes and laminate wood floor \t\t\t\t\r\nc.3.9x2.7m\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: with built in wardrobes and laminate wood floor\t\t\t\t\r\nc.3.9x2.1m\r\n\r\nBathroom:  with bath, W.C, W.H.B, partially tiled walls and tiled floor"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Outside \t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\r\nPrivate patio area with access to common garden \r\nAllocated car-parking space\r\nCourtyard style landscaped common gardens with gated access to the royal canal \r\nGated development with security gates \r\n\r\n\r\nServices\r\nRational wooden double-glazed windows \r\nElectric storage central heating\r\nIntercom \r\nWired for alarm \r\nService Charge c. €2,260 per annum"
      },
